WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
A sentence appears. Familiarity begins with one encounter.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Two weeks later, the sentence returns.
Nothing has been independently verified.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Repeated factual claims can feel truer
than new claims in experimental tasks.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
A familiar phrase is not a source,
a clinical study or a product trial.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Ask what evidence would actually support it.
Check before repetition settles in.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Read the sources. Try the free practice.
The offer remains disabled until authorized.
